# Outputs of reproduce_paper.py. Tracked: trained models (weights and tuned
# thresholds), the encoders needed to apply them, each experiment's test split
# and report, the learning-curve CSVs, results/ and figures/.
# Ignored below: training by-products that are not needed to reuse the models
# or to recompute the paper's numbers.
experiments/*/mlflow.db
experiments/*/mlflow.db-journal
experiments/*/mlruns/
experiments/*/catboost_info/
experiments/catboost_info/
experiments/mlruns/
catboost_info/
experiments/learning_curve/
experiments/*/splits/*
!experiments/*/splits/test_df.gpkg
experiments/*/preprocessed_splits/*
!experiments/*/preprocessed_splits/test_preprocessed.csv
!experiments/*/preprocessed_splits/preprocessor.pkl
!experiments/*/preprocessed_splits/label_encoder.pkl
!experiments/*/preprocessed_splits/preprocessing.json

